@baseUrl = https://localhost:7295
@accessToken = THAY_BANG_JWT
@notificationId = THAY_BANG_GUID_THONG_BAO

### 1. Danh sach thong bao, phan trang mac dinh
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. Chi xem thong bao chua doc
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications?isRead=false&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3. Loc theo loai thong bao
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications?type=Booking&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. Loc ket hop va sang trang tiep theo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications?isRead=false&type=Payment&page=2&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. Dem thong bao chua doc
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Danh dau mot thong bao da doc
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Danh dau tat ca thong bao da doc
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. Kiem tra page khong hop le (mong doi 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications?page=0&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 9. Kiem tra pageSize vuot gioi han (mong doi 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications?page=1&pageSize=51
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
